Write a payment follow-up email.

Details:
- Freelancer name: {{ $json.freelancerName }}
- Client name: {{ $json.clientName }}
- Invoice ID: {{ $json.invoiceId }}
- Project: {{ $json.projectName || 'not specified' }}
- Amount: {{ $json.currency }} {{ $json.amount.toLocaleString() }}
- Due date: {{ $json.dueDate }}
- Days overdue: {{ $json.daysOverdue }}
- Chase stage: {{ $json.stage }} of 4
- Times chased before: {{ $json.chaseCount }}

Additional context: {{ $json.notes || 'none' }}

Write only the email body. Start with 'Hi {{ $json.clientName }},'

